 InterestPrint® Front Zip Racer Back Sports Skirt & Shorts Set 
 Type: 80% Polyester + 20% Spandex, for Women, All Over Printing 
 Made from 80% polyester and 20% spandex, durable and comfortable.
 This sporty set features a front-zip top with a secure racerback design and a matching skirt with built-in shorts for coverage and freedom of movement, all crafted from breathable, moisture-wicking fabric for ultimate comfort and flexibility during activity.
 Perfect For Yoga, tennis, running, gym sessions, hiking, or casual weekend wear.
 Size: S, M, L, XL, 2XL, 3XL, 4XL, 5XL. Calculate your size from the measurement chart below please.
 The zipper is available in white or black.
 Care Instructions: Hand or machine washable. Avoid prolonged soaking. Do not bleach. Wash at temperatures ≤45ºC.
