 InterestPrint®Cross Back String Sports Bra&High Waist Shorts Active Sets 
 Type: Polyester, Two Pieces, All Over Printing 
 6.21 oz. Crafted from soft, elastic polyester with 4-way stretch, this activewear is lightweight, breathable, and moisture-wicking. Its non-see-through design offers confidence and comfort for any workout.
 Sexy Seamless Backless Sports Bra:
Sleeveless crop tank tops, criss cross back strap, removable pads, Wide ribbed hem,
provide medium support and stays in place. Tummy Control Butt Lifting Athletic Shorts:
Sexy scrunch booty, Compression high waist wide waistband, Pass the squat test, No
front seam, No camel toe.
 This sexy workout set is perfect for yoga, gym, fitness,
sports, running, workout, jogging and daily wear.
 Please order 2 brand logos if you'd like to add your brand logo for this product.
 Machine wash or hand wash, fast drying, easy to care for, durable.
