 InterestPrint® Backless Split Knotted Yoga Active Tank Tops 
 Type: 88% Polyester + 12% Spandex, for Women, All Over Printing 
 Made from 88% polyester and 12% spandex, offers a silky-smooth hand-feel and is luxuriously lightweight. 
 Featuring a sleeveless scoop-neck front, a breathable layered open-back design, and an asymmetrical pointed hem for enhanced airflow, easy movement, and a relaxed fit.
 Suitable for women of all ages: If you are a mom and don't want it to cling to your belly, you can leave it untied in the back. This is perfect for covering your stomach with a loose, comfortable fit. If you love the gym, simply tie it in the back to create a crop top length and show off your toned physique.
